Z||000000||My7Fieros||06-12-2000||12:39 AM||||Hey I just wanted to thank everyone here in the forum who helped me out with my car. All of a sudden it wouldnt start, discovered no spark. I replaced alot of things to no avail. Some of you recommended a new pick up coil on the distribtor, so tonite I pulled the distributor, cleaned, and put one in (thanx to a website link a forum member posted). She fired right up! I havnt checked to see if the stalling prob. is fixed yet because I have to put on a new water pump and fill the system...none the less, she started and runs great! Thanx forum!||||reg||10
